-- A script that reaches a yield out of an imported module, for checking that
-- `thena-check` refuses one: a batch checker has nobody to hand control to
-- (MS12 phase 309).
--
-- It is a script and not a bare module because `thena-check`'s rule-file door
-- replaces the pool, which drops the shipped base the yielding clause is layered
-- over; `:consult` pushes.
:consult test/modules/Pausing.thena.rules
import test.modules.Pauses
